 # Möller-Trumbore Ray-Triangle Intersection
 
-Also called: IntersectsRayTriangle, MT Algorithm, Möller-Trumbore, Ray-Triangle Intersection (Möller-Trumbore), Triangle-Ray Intersection (Möller-Trumbore variant)
